  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.3817138671875,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "different regimen options; therefore, the establishment and strengthening of DST services is a vital",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.443115234375,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "consideration for implementation. The DST methods for identifying resistance to bedaquiline and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.6184692382812,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "linezolid have been developed on available phenotypic platforms and need to be implemented in all",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997300148010254,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.172119140625,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "settings where these medicines are being used. Resistance to other anti-TB drugs should be monitored",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.956262588500977,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        276.7190246582031,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "in accordance with WHO recommendations.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.442138671875,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "One of the exclusion criteria for all shorter regimens in the datasets from South Africa was mutations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        153.81874084472656,
        527.3861694335938,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "inh kat in both  A promoter and  G regions, confirmed using a line probe assay (LPA). This means that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        167.01869201660156,
        527.5035400390625,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "inh kat patients with only  A or only  G mutations were included. A first-line LPA (MTBDRplus) and Xpert",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.996950149536133,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        180.2187042236328,
        527.4169921875,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "inh kat MTB/XDR cartridge can determine mutations in the  A promoter or  G regions; both mutations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        193.41871643066406,
        527.4182739257812,
        209.13771057128906
      ],
      "text": "inh confer resistance to isoniazid, with the resistance being low level when  A mutations alone are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        206.6186065673828,
        527.4207153320312,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "kat inh kat present, or high level with  G gene mutations alone or  A promoter and  G gene mutations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        219.81874084472656,
        527.4240112304688,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "inh combined. Mutations at the  A promoter are also associated with resistance to ethionamide and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        233.01869201660156,
        527.412841796875,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "inh kat prothionamide. The presence of mutations in both the  A promoter and  G suggests that isoniazid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.959074020385742,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.3946533203125,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "at high dose and thioamides are not effective, and that the 9-month regimen may not therefore be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.6947021484375,
        527.5452270507812,
        275.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "used. In the absence of information on mutation patterns for an individual patient, the decision can be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.971412658691406,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        527.40673828125,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "informed by knowledge of the frequency of the concurrent occurrence of both mutations, obtained",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        285.8187255859375,
        527.4449462890625,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "(62) from drug-resistance surveillance  . Phenotypic DST for some medicines included in the regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.294677734375,
        527.1989135742188,
        314.7377014160156
      ],
      "text": "(e.g. ethambutol and ethionamide) is not considered reliable and reproducible; therefore, this testing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994698524475098,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        313.49468994140625,
        386.2127990722656,
        327.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "should be employed with caution to inform the use of this regimen. 36",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.6333618164062,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "Currently, there is limited capacity globally to carry out DST for bedaquiline; however, laboratory",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39862060546875,
        527.2562866210938,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "capacity should be strengthened in this area as new medicines and regimens begin to be used",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        527.394775390625,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "more widely. National and reference laboratories will need to have the relevant reagents available to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        373.5226135253906,
        527.4345092773438,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis enable DST to be carried out and will need data on the MIC distribution of all   lineages",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.989794731140137,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.99859619140625,
        527.4322509765625,
        402.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "that are circulating globally. The WHO TB SRL Network is available to support national TB reference",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.1986083984375,
        527.4332885742188,
        415.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "laboratories in performing quality-assured DST. A WHO technical consultation in 2017 established",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.39862060546875,
        527.1614990234375,
        428.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "critical concentrations for susceptibility testing for the fluoroquinolones, bedaquiline, delamanid,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        426.3226013183594,
        206.83349609375,
        442.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "(43) clofazimine and linezolid  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        458.4425048828125,
        231.56533813476562,
        474.1025085449219
      ],
      "text": "Selection of fluoroquinolones",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        481.3103942871094,
        527.4300537109375,
        495.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "Selection of fluoroquinolones may take into account the evidence from South Africa available for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        494.5104064941406,
        527.5797119140625,
        508.95343017578125
      ],
      "text": "the review – 83% of patients analysed using the 2017 dataset received levofloxacin and the rest",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.71044921875,
        527.3887939453125,
        522.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "received moxifloxacin at standard dose (400 mg daily). Both levofloxacin and moxifloxacin have",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        520.910400390625,
        527.594970703125,
        535.3533935546875
      ],
      "text": "shown similar efficacy for treating DR-TB. The choice between levofloxacin and moxifloxacin was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        534.1104125976562,
        527.4509887695312,
        548.5534057617188
      ],
      "text": "guided by the potential risk of cumulative cardiotoxicity, using moxifloxacin in a shorter regimen with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        547.3104248046875,
        527.4288330078125,
        561.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "injectables and levofloxacin in an all-oral shorter regimen. Levofloxacin is often preferred because of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        560.5103759765625,
        527.4046630859375,
        574.953369140625
      ],
      "text": "moxifloxacin’s slightly higher potential for cardiotoxicity; however, levofloxacin has been associated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        573.71044921875,
        527.236572265625,
        588.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "with musculoskeletal disorders in paediatric populations. Therefore, irrespective of the choice of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        585.634521484375,
        527.3932495117188,
        601.353515625
      ],
      "text": "(64, 65) fluoroquinolone, NTPs need to implement aDSM in all patients enrolled on treatment of DR-TB  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.948127746582031,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        617.7543334960938,
        208.9322052001953,
        633.4143676757812
      ],
      "text": "Assessment of TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        640.6221923828125,
        527.338623046875,
        655.065185546875
      ],
      "text": "To determine regimen options, it is important to know the extent of TB disease, in addition to the DST",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987442970275879,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        653.8223266601562,
        527.4348754882812,
        668.2653198242188
      ],
      "text": "results and other considerations mentioned above. Extensive TB disease is defined in this document as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966499328613281,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        667.022216796875,
        527.1558227539062,
        681.4652099609375
      ],
      "text": "the presence of bilateral cavitary disease or extensive parenchymal damage on CXR. In children aged",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.989495277404785,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        680.22216796875,
        527.4235229492188,
        694.6651611328125
      ],
      "text": "below 15 years, advanced disease is usually defined by the presence of cavities or bilateral disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        693.4222412109375,
        527.4036254882812,
        707.865234375
      ],
      "text": "on CXR. This highlights the importance of CXR as part of the diagnostic and clinical management",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        706.6221923828125,
        165.68289184570312,
        721.065185546875
      ],
      "text": "work-up for patients.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        749.8719482421875,
        526.6378784179688,
        763.5758666992188
      ],
      "text": "See the list of high-confidence resistance-conferring mutations in the WHO guide on the use of next-generation sequencing technologies,  36",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 7.966279029846191,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86620330810547,
        761.743896484375,
        139.17730712890625,
        773.1759033203125
      ],
      "text": "2018 (63) WHO ( )  .",
